### VULN-037 — No global JSON body-size limit (memory-exhaustion DoS)
### Any JSON endpoint buffers the whole body before Zod; no 413 at tens of MB.
POST http://localhost:21527/agent/credits/purchase HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 203.0.113.209

<<30 MB of bytes>>            # server buffers all of it, then 400s on JSON parse (no 413)
